WEBVTT

01:41.720 --> 01:49.030
[Genius Girlfriend]

01:49.130 --> 01:51.890
[Episode 28]

01:54.950 --> 01:56.350
How long until you leave?

01:56.710 --> 01:57.560
A week.

02:03.310 --> 02:05.310
I'll come back when I'm on vacation.

02:05.970 --> 02:11.750
♪ Only for this lingering warmth
of the moment ♪

02:08.470 --> 02:09.930
You can also come visit me.

02:13.130 --> 02:19.050
♪ Trading souls with the night ♪

02:14.780 --> 02:17.240
I'll call you every day.

02:19.940 --> 02:25.350
♪ Every dusk I have stolen ♪

02:23.150 --> 02:24.190
Are you upset?

02:26.960 --> 02:34.100
♪ Foretells a parting ♪

02:35.280 --> 02:41.690
♪ Where did the storm start brewing ♪

02:42.450 --> 02:48.050
♪ Drenching you before we knew it? ♪

02:48.829 --> 02:51.720
♪ Let me draw near to you ♪

02:52.390 --> 02:55.280
♪ Let me imagine you ♪

02:55.750 --> 02:58.030
♪ Let me sink into your ♪

02:58.380 --> 03:02.070
♪ Scattered golden glow ♪

03:02.850 --> 03:05.320
♪ Let the night blur your figure ♪

03:06.030 --> 03:08.850
♪ Yet tear myself away from you ♪

03:09.520 --> 03:12.120
♪ I can't fathom why ♪

03:12.870 --> 03:16.210
♪ I've never truly possessed you ♪

03:16.930 --> 03:20.100
♪ That blazing, radiant feeling ♪

03:20.520 --> 03:23.270
♪ Once the rain stops, clouds disperse ♪

03:23.860 --> 03:29.790
♪ Hence, time and again, I lose ♪

03:30.390 --> 03:33.760
♪ Myself ♪

03:53.380 --> 03:57.829
[Shui]

03:54.800 --> 03:55.630
Dr. Shen.

03:56.000 --> 03:58.130
I've started a new round of treatment.

03:58.240 --> 04:00.770
The doctor said
this one is really important,

04:01.520 --> 04:03.430
but it really hurts.

04:04.470 --> 04:05.870
And they use a lot of medical terms

04:05.870 --> 04:07.330
in English, so I can barely

04:07.470 --> 04:09.280
make sense of what they're saying.

04:09.280 --> 04:10.280
I'm totally lost.

04:13.030 --> 04:14.520
I told you to learn English ages ago,

04:14.520 --> 04:17.850
but you thought it was too much trouble
and refused to learn.

04:20.870 --> 04:22.040
Can't you comfort me a little

04:22.040 --> 04:24.160
when I'm already like this?

04:25.630 --> 04:27.360
But I won't hold it against you.

04:27.360 --> 04:28.560
Let me tell you something.

04:28.560 --> 04:30.960
I'm about to be moved into
the sterile room.

04:31.390 --> 04:32.470
Does that mean

04:32.600 --> 04:34.659
it'll soon be my turn to have surgery?

04:38.360 --> 04:39.960
The nurse is urging me to go in

04:40.190 --> 04:41.680
and won't let me bring my phone.

04:41.680 --> 04:42.720
But don't worry.

04:43.000 --> 04:44.200
I'll keep you posted.

04:44.270 --> 04:45.000
Bye.

04:48.480 --> 04:49.210
Stay strong.

04:50.190 --> 04:52.120
I'll be waiting for your good news.

05:19.360 --> 05:20.040
Tingting!

05:36.720 --> 05:37.720
Duan Qiyan?

05:45.000 --> 05:46.120
W-Why are you here?

05:46.120 --> 05:47.320
What's with this car?

05:48.480 --> 05:49.870
I borrowed it, of course.

05:49.870 --> 05:52.950
Hou Wei has been completely
at my beck and call lately.

05:53.050 --> 05:54.190
I asked him for a car,

05:54.190 --> 05:55.750
and without a second thought,
he lent it to me right away.

05:55.750 --> 05:56.480
How is it?

05:56.560 --> 05:57.360
Isn't it cool?

05:59.159 --> 06:00.360
Cool my foot.

06:00.430 --> 06:01.920
Don't you find it embarrassing?

06:01.920 --> 06:03.200
How is this embarrassing?

06:03.200 --> 06:04.800
Of course I should make a big show of it

06:04.800 --> 06:05.800
when I pick up my girlfriend from work.

06:05.800 --> 06:06.800
It's the most basic courtesy
and sense of ceremony

06:06.800 --> 06:08.600
I should have as your boyfriend.

06:11.510 --> 06:12.360
Boyfriend?

06:14.680 --> 06:15.430
Hello.

06:15.720 --> 06:17.920
I'm Tingting's boyfriend, Duan Qiyan.

06:22.190 --> 06:23.410
Is it really necessary

06:23.410 --> 06:24.240
to make such a big deal

06:24.240 --> 06:25.120
out of something so small?

06:25.120 --> 06:25.920
Of course it is.

06:25.920 --> 06:27.650
With a wife as wonderful as you,

06:27.750 --> 06:30.600
I have to announce it to
the whole world, don't I?

06:31.480 --> 06:32.740
Give it a rest already.

06:32.750 --> 06:35.010
We're right at the entrance of my office.

06:36.750 --> 06:38.680
Alright, you've worked hard today.

06:38.680 --> 06:40.240
Tell me what you want to eat,

06:40.240 --> 06:41.440
and I'll take you out.

06:47.480 --> 06:49.390
Since there's someone else here
to pick you up, I'll get going then.

06:49.390 --> 06:50.720
Be safe on your way back.

06:50.800 --> 06:51.950
Alright, you too.

06:52.000 --> 06:52.720
Rest early.

06:54.800 --> 06:55.390
Bye-bye.

06:56.040 --> 06:56.920
Bye-bye.

07:05.360 --> 07:06.310
Nice car.

07:07.310 --> 07:08.270
Isn't it?

07:08.270 --> 07:10.070
What do you want to eat? Let's go.

07:10.160 --> 07:11.750
Something expensive.

07:19.800 --> 07:20.560
Hello, sir.

07:20.500 --> 07:24.500
[DR Engagement Ring]

07:20.560 --> 07:22.000
How can I help you?

07:24.360 --> 07:25.480
I'd like to buy an engagement ring.

07:24.500 --> 07:27.430
[The Only One for Only You]

07:25.870 --> 07:27.630
Do you have any unique designs?

07:27.750 --> 07:28.600
So what kind of girl

07:28.600 --> 07:30.070
is your girlfriend?

07:33.360 --> 07:34.430
She's like a star

07:35.270 --> 07:37.670
that dispels the darkness
in the night sky.

07:37.720 --> 07:38.560
She's the most beautiful

07:38.560 --> 07:40.560
and intelligent girl I've ever met.

07:41.750 --> 07:42.880
Once you've met her,

07:43.430 --> 07:45.310
there's no room in your heart
for anyone else.

07:45.310 --> 07:46.120
You might want to take a look at

07:46.120 --> 07:47.720
at our DR HEART collection.

07:48.950 --> 07:50.190
HEART stands for true love—

07:50.190 --> 07:53.159
it allows you to give your most
sincere feelings to your partner.

07:53.159 --> 07:53.750
Plus,

07:53.750 --> 07:56.240
our DR rings are meant to be given to
only one person in a lifetime

07:56.240 --> 07:58.970
symbolizing your commitment
to loving only her.

08:01.270 --> 08:02.200
It's beautiful.

08:02.360 --> 08:03.050
I'll take this one.

08:03.050 --> 08:04.410
[DR Engagement Ring]

08:03.130 --> 08:03.390
Sure.

08:03.390 --> 08:05.220
If you're sure you want this ring,

08:04.410 --> 08:05.410
[The Only One for Only You]

08:05.220 --> 08:07.880
you'll need to sign
this "True Love Agreement."

08:08.560 --> 08:09.620
Please take a look.

08:33.320 --> 08:34.780
How's your packing going?

08:35.750 --> 08:38.360
I'm almost done with
clothes and daily necessities.

08:38.360 --> 08:40.360
Just a few small things left to pack.

08:42.270 --> 08:44.510
I still have to go to the hospital
to pick up my medical exam results.

08:44.510 --> 08:45.840
I'm running out of time.

08:48.910 --> 08:50.550
I've prepared some common medicines
for you—

08:50.550 --> 08:53.030
cold remedy, allergy medicine,
stomach medicine, etc.

08:53.030 --> 08:53.720
There are also

08:53.720 --> 08:55.600
band-aids and disinfectant wipes
at the bottom.

08:55.600 --> 08:56.550
I've labeled everything.

08:56.550 --> 08:58.510
If you can't find anything,
give me a call.

08:58.510 --> 09:00.120
When did you prepare all this?

09:00.120 --> 09:01.510
I started preparing it when I found out

09:01.510 --> 09:03.080
you were going to join a closed program.

09:03.080 --> 09:03.940
I also included

09:04.720 --> 09:06.360
some chargers, adapters,

09:06.360 --> 09:08.150
data cables, and stuff like that—

09:08.150 --> 09:09.120
I packed 3 sets of each

09:09.120 --> 09:10.250
in case you lose one.

09:12.320 --> 09:13.320
And a flashlight.

09:13.480 --> 09:15.940
It'll come in handy
in case of a power outage.

09:16.130 --> 09:17.770
I'm going to a closed experiment,

09:17.770 --> 09:19.410
not going on a wilderness survival trip.

09:19.410 --> 09:21.650
I can buy all these at the base.

09:32.050 --> 09:33.180
Make sure to eat well

09:33.340 --> 09:34.370
after I'm gone.

09:37.010 --> 09:37.700
Got it.

09:50.370 --> 09:51.530
Review your grad school prep materials

09:51.530 --> 09:52.590
when you have time.

09:53.170 --> 09:54.890
Got it, Ms. Lin.

10:03.770 --> 10:05.130
There are also 2 warm sweaters.

10:05.130 --> 10:07.330
Make sure to bundle up when it gets cold.

10:09.770 --> 10:11.250
You don't have to worry about me
that much.

10:11.250 --> 10:13.050
Of course I'm worried about you.

10:13.170 --> 10:14.500
I'm just as worried about you

10:14.500 --> 10:15.560
as you are about me.

10:19.890 --> 10:21.220
Alright, I promise you.

10:21.290 --> 10:22.290
After you leave,

10:22.500 --> 10:24.650
I'll definitely take good care of myself,

10:24.650 --> 10:25.620
eat well,

10:26.050 --> 10:26.940
study hard,

10:27.250 --> 10:28.740
and video call you every day to check in.

10:28.740 --> 10:31.010
I'll be the first to pick you up
when you get back,

10:31.010 --> 10:32.700
and you can reach me anytime.

10:33.250 --> 10:35.580
I absolutely won't let you worry, Ms. Lin.

11:25.940 --> 11:28.140
Jiang Yubai, do you have time tomorrow?

11:30.740 --> 11:31.800
Let's get married.

11:36.650 --> 11:37.700
Are you serious?

11:42.530 --> 11:43.510
Of course I am.

11:48.860 --> 11:50.990
You've come such a long way on your own,

11:52.130 --> 11:54.330
and I don't want you to be all alone again

11:54.530 --> 11:56.500
after I'm gone.

11:58.650 --> 12:00.130
Just thinking about you
being all by yourself

12:00.130 --> 12:01.340
makes me so sad.

12:04.410 --> 12:05.650
Once we're married,

12:06.410 --> 12:07.270
you'll have me,

12:07.650 --> 12:08.460
Zeqiu,

12:08.700 --> 12:09.700
and my parents.

12:10.530 --> 12:12.330
Then you won't be alone anymore.

12:12.500 --> 12:14.890
No matter where you are
or what you're doing,

12:14.890 --> 12:17.220
there will always be someone by your side.

12:19.290 --> 12:20.890
I want to entrust you to them,

12:22.500 --> 12:24.860
and I also want to entrust them to you.

12:27.050 --> 12:27.740
I...

12:28.340 --> 12:30.500
I still have a lot to prepare.

12:31.100 --> 12:33.010
Like the rings, flowers,

12:33.010 --> 12:34.610
pre-wedding photos, and...

12:34.870 --> 12:35.930
No need to prepare.

12:38.910 --> 12:40.910
You don't need to prepare anything.

12:43.750 --> 12:45.480
I just want us to become a family

12:47.410 --> 12:48.620
before I leave.

13:02.100 --> 13:03.900
Can I take you to a place tonight?

13:22.650 --> 13:23.370
Su Mo.

13:23.820 --> 13:25.150
What are you doing here?

13:26.650 --> 13:27.410
Tingting.

13:28.460 --> 13:30.060
I have something to tell you.

13:31.740 --> 13:32.460
What is it?

13:38.890 --> 13:41.890
I've been thinking about something
for quite a while.

13:48.250 --> 13:51.010
I've decided to switch to Ms. Zhou's team.

13:54.370 --> 13:55.370
We were working together just fine.

13:55.370 --> 13:57.830
Why did you suddenly decide
to switch teams?

14:00.290 --> 14:01.700
I have to.

14:03.290 --> 14:04.980
I don't know how to face you.

14:08.170 --> 14:09.770
You don't know how to face me?

14:10.340 --> 14:11.130
Why?

14:12.940 --> 14:14.130
It's not your fault.

14:14.130 --> 14:15.170
It's mine.

14:15.860 --> 14:17.410
When I saw you with another guy,

14:17.410 --> 14:18.410
I got really mad.

14:18.580 --> 14:19.460
I couldn't even

14:19.460 --> 14:20.940
control my own emotions.

14:21.340 --> 14:22.870
I didn't know how to face you

14:23.100 --> 14:23.670
or how to

14:23.670 --> 14:25.340
manage my feelings.

14:25.980 --> 14:27.130
I don't want my emotions

14:27.130 --> 14:28.580
to affect your life

14:29.050 --> 14:30.410
or our work together,

14:31.220 --> 14:32.620
so I've decided to leave.

14:33.100 --> 14:35.100
It's for the best for both of us.

14:45.940 --> 14:46.740
Tingting.

14:49.370 --> 14:51.830
You're the best agent
I've ever worked with.

14:53.410 --> 14:55.410
If one day I come to terms with things

14:55.860 --> 14:56.700
and let go,

14:58.860 --> 15:01.990
I'll definitely reach out to you
to work together again.

15:07.740 --> 15:09.140
I respect your decision,

15:09.860 --> 15:12.320
and you're always welcome
to come back to me.

15:24.460 --> 15:25.250
Then...

15:26.370 --> 15:27.500
I'll be leaving now.

15:51.860 --> 15:53.370
No matter what Zhou arranges for you,

15:53.370 --> 15:54.500
remember this:

15:55.170 --> 15:57.700
acting well is the foundation
of your career.

15:57.980 --> 16:00.980
When you're surrounded by distractions
that threaten to blind you, you need to

16:00.980 --> 16:02.860
stay clear-headed and never lose sight of
your original purpose.

16:02.860 --> 16:06.060
Otherwise, the higher you climb,
the harder you'll fall.

16:07.290 --> 16:09.750
Su Mo, keep working hard
and give it your all.

16:14.770 --> 16:16.170
Rest assured, Tingting.

16:17.370 --> 16:18.460
I'll do my best.

16:33.740 --> 16:35.410
How are you handling the news

16:35.650 --> 16:37.310
that Su Mo is switching teams?

16:39.250 --> 16:41.740
Although you've personally mentored him
from the start,

16:41.740 --> 16:43.740
switching teams was his own request.

16:43.740 --> 16:44.820
As a company,

16:44.820 --> 16:47.020
we should respect the artist's choice.

16:47.220 --> 16:49.550
I believe you can understand that, right?

16:53.340 --> 16:54.700
But I've always recognized

16:54.700 --> 16:55.980
your personal abilities

16:55.980 --> 16:57.770
and your contributions to the company.

16:57.770 --> 16:58.890
So today,

16:58.910 --> 17:00.650
I have something to announce.

17:04.700 --> 17:05.900
Starting today,

17:06.089 --> 17:08.020
you'll be in charge of Agent Team 2.

17:09.250 --> 17:11.310
So you're now the head of Agent Team 2.

17:15.290 --> 17:17.290
Thank you, Mr. Li, and thank you
to the company for your trust.

17:17.290 --> 17:18.530
I'll continue to work hard

17:18.530 --> 17:20.260
and strive for better results.

17:20.500 --> 17:21.290
All right.

17:21.569 --> 17:23.609
Going forward, get to know the colleagues
in Team Two better

17:23.609 --> 17:25.410
and communicate with them more.

17:25.540 --> 17:27.010
Work steadily to move Team 2's projects

17:27.010 --> 17:27.940
forward.

17:28.460 --> 17:29.420
If you run into any difficulties

17:29.420 --> 17:30.570
or need any help,

17:30.570 --> 17:31.970
just let me know anytime.

17:34.610 --> 17:36.500
Mr. Li, since you said

17:36.900 --> 17:39.010
I could bring up any requests
whenever I have them,

17:39.010 --> 17:41.410
I might as well just get it
out of the way now.

17:41.500 --> 17:43.090
Alright, go ahead and tell me.

17:43.090 --> 17:44.290
There's a young lady
in the Planning Department

17:44.290 --> 17:45.140
named Min.

17:45.140 --> 17:46.420
She's very skilled at script planning.

17:46.420 --> 17:48.280
Could you transfer her to my team?

17:48.780 --> 17:50.610
Sure. Coordinate with
the Planning Department

17:50.610 --> 17:52.570
and have her transferred directly
to your team.

17:52.570 --> 17:53.770
Also,

17:53.810 --> 17:55.290
regarding new media...

17:57.440 --> 17:58.900
Just lay it all out at once.

18:01.050 --> 18:01.900
Regarding new media,

18:01.900 --> 18:03.180
I'd like to hire one more person,
mainly responsible for

18:03.180 --> 18:06.010
managing and following up on
the artists' short-video content.

18:06.010 --> 18:06.940
Internally,

18:06.940 --> 18:08.570
I won't compete with Team 1
for new talent.

18:08.570 --> 18:09.900
But for external projects,

18:09.900 --> 18:11.500
do you think it'd be possible
for the artists from both Team 1 and 2

18:11.500 --> 18:12.700
to meet with them at the same time?

18:12.700 --> 18:14.330
We have to treat everyone fairly,
after all.

18:14.330 --> 18:15.180
I don't have a problem with that.

18:15.180 --> 18:18.440
I'm just worried about
how the artists might feel about it.

18:18.740 --> 18:19.700
Everything else is fine.

18:19.700 --> 18:20.760
That's all for now.

18:23.010 --> 18:24.850
You "don't have a problem with that"?

18:24.850 --> 18:25.900
And "that's all"?

18:27.770 --> 18:30.420
You're fighting for resources
and grabbing people left and right.

18:30.420 --> 18:33.020
I'm just doing this
for the good of the company.

18:33.700 --> 18:34.380
Alright.

18:35.180 --> 18:36.740
I'll give you everyone you asked for,

18:36.740 --> 18:38.940
and from now on, I'll notify you
whenever there are major projects.

18:38.940 --> 18:39.870
Is that settled?

18:40.140 --> 18:41.140
Thank you, Mr. Li.

18:41.380 --> 18:43.090
I'll definitely keep working hard.

18:43.090 --> 18:43.900
Keep it up.

18:58.330 --> 19:00.660
Jiang Yubai, I've arrived. Where are you?

19:04.380 --> 19:09.310
[Jiang Yubai]

19:06.610 --> 19:08.210
Go wait for me under the tree.

19:08.220 --> 19:09.350
I'll be right there.

19:45.220 --> 19:46.610
L-L-L-L-Lin Zhixia.

19:46.920 --> 19:47.440
Hello.

19:47.920 --> 19:49.720
Today, I want to tell you a story.

19:50.250 --> 19:51.710
A story about a little boy.

19:53.680 --> 19:54.750
Jiang

19:54.920 --> 19:58.570
has been a proud and sensitive boy
since childhood.

19:59.010 --> 20:00.410
He's highly competitive

20:00.680 --> 20:02.880
and consistently ranked first
in every subject—

20:02.880 --> 20:05.140
until he transferred schools
in fourth grade

20:05.140 --> 20:07.480
and met a girl he could never beat:

20:08.570 --> 20:09.330
Lin Zhixia.

20:23.270 --> 20:24.200
Do you remember?

20:25.110 --> 20:27.770
Jiang's an expert at
folding paper airplanes.

20:28.400 --> 20:31.530
He even won first place
in a paper airplane contest once.

20:32.310 --> 20:34.750
The paper airplanes he folded
had a kind of magic.

20:34.750 --> 20:37.070
It was as if they were equipped with
a built-in navigation system,

20:37.070 --> 20:39.730
able to find Lin Zhixia
with pinpoint accuracy.

20:40.610 --> 20:43.240
And there was another hidden feature.

20:45.290 --> 20:47.950
When the paper airplane
flew toward Lin Zhixia,

20:48.590 --> 20:51.090
it served as Jiang's opening line,

20:52.050 --> 20:54.310
conveying his desire to get closer to her

20:54.770 --> 20:58.300
on his behalf when he didn't know
how to start the conversation.

21:19.740 --> 21:21.720
[Become a genius like Lin Zhixia]

21:28.200 --> 21:29.400
He liked Lin Zhixia,

21:29.740 --> 21:31.400
yet he also wanted to beat her—

21:31.570 --> 21:32.750
these two emotions

21:33.000 --> 21:35.600
were constantly at odds
in Jiang Yubai's mind.

21:35.960 --> 21:39.090
Perhaps that was just
the conflict of adolescence.

21:39.570 --> 21:41.140
Sometimes, he'd even dream

21:40.320 --> 21:41.450
[Become a genius like Lin Zhixia]

21:41.480 --> 21:42.590
[Become best friends with Jiang Yubai]

21:41.590 --> 21:43.070
that he had come in first place.

21:43.070 --> 21:45.110
And in the dream, he'd comfort Lin Zhixia.

21:45.110 --> 21:47.380
It's just that
I don't want to win because of you.

21:47.380 --> 21:50.910
And even less do I want to be known as
the teammate of some genius.

21:51.900 --> 21:53.360
I'd always been number one

21:53.460 --> 21:55.260
when you were not in the picture.

21:55.740 --> 21:58.090
And I want to see just how big the gap
between us really is

21:58.090 --> 22:00.090
when we compete against each other.

22:01.750 --> 22:03.590
But at some point,

22:04.010 --> 22:06.220
[The 6th Nanhai Provincial Symposium
on Marine Science Development]

22:04.310 --> 22:06.110
he stopped feeling conflicted.

22:06.790 --> 22:08.640
He accepted that the person he liked

22:08.640 --> 22:09.770
was better than him.

22:10.750 --> 22:12.850
Even if all he could do
was look up to her,

22:12.850 --> 22:13.680
support her,

22:14.640 --> 22:15.770
and stay by her side,

22:16.640 --> 22:17.700
he was still happy.

22:18.590 --> 22:19.920
No matter when or where,

22:20.380 --> 22:22.460
Lin Zhixia would always be number one

22:23.330 --> 22:24.660
in Jiang Yubai's heart.

22:46.240 --> 22:47.070
That night,

22:48.590 --> 22:49.660
Jiang Yubai and Lin Zhixia

22:49.660 --> 22:51.550
talked a lot about the universe.

22:52.990 --> 22:53.700
They even planned

22:53.700 --> 22:57.160
to take a picture with
the Sirius starlight from 8.6 years ago.

22:57.960 --> 22:59.690
Lin Zhixia probably had no idea

23:00.310 --> 23:02.710
how frustrated Jiang Yubai was
at the time—

23:03.270 --> 23:04.800
why his hands kept shaking,

23:05.680 --> 23:08.880
and why he hadn't adjusted
the camera settings properly.

23:09.790 --> 23:12.050
Fortunately, on the bus,

23:10.270 --> 23:15.440
[Happiness Is Actually So Simple]

23:13.310 --> 23:16.570
when Lin Zhixia fell asleep
leaning against his shoulder,

23:17.240 --> 23:19.840
Jiang Yubai took
another shot of them together

23:20.290 --> 23:22.950
and has cherished it like a treasure
ever since.

23:24.290 --> 23:25.280
I did the math.

23:26.310 --> 23:28.510
The light emitted by Sirius at that time

23:29.240 --> 23:31.050
might have reached Earth by now,

23:33.180 --> 23:34.840
and Jiang Yubai and Lin Zhixia

23:35.830 --> 23:36.960
are still together.

23:47.240 --> 23:49.640
Jiang Yubai often asks himself a question:

23:50.460 --> 23:52.770
Is he a lucky person or not?

23:54.400 --> 23:56.330
It seems that throughout his life,

23:57.250 --> 23:59.220
sudden upheavals have always

23:59.830 --> 24:01.830
disrupted his peaceful existence.

24:02.960 --> 24:04.290
But he feels fortunate.

24:06.030 --> 24:08.890
Perhaps all the bad things
that have happened to him

24:09.080 --> 24:11.610
have been redeemed by
one huge stroke of luck:

24:12.500 --> 24:14.300
being chosen by the fallen leaf.

24:15.240 --> 24:16.700
The odds of that happening

24:16.750 --> 24:18.460
are as slim as a tossed coin

24:18.490 --> 24:20.490
landing upright in a crack in a rock,

24:21.010 --> 24:23.770
as rare as two people meeting
in a vast crowd,

24:24.900 --> 24:28.940
or as unlikely as the person you like
happening to like you back.

24:31.640 --> 24:33.170
That bet under the big tree—

24:34.720 --> 24:35.780
he was lucky enough

24:36.810 --> 24:37.530
to lose it.

24:39.710 --> 24:40.660
All along,

24:41.250 --> 24:43.980
Jiang Yubai has been a boy
who never quite grew up.

24:44.010 --> 24:45.140
He's made mistakes,

24:45.550 --> 24:48.270
had doubts, and lost his way.

24:49.590 --> 24:52.050
But fortunately, Lin Zhixia
has always been there

24:52.050 --> 24:55.070
to pull him back to her side
time and time again.

24:56.010 --> 24:57.940
As long as Lin Zhixia is by his side,

24:58.480 --> 25:02.940
Jiang Yubai has the courage
to face anything.

25:22.460 --> 25:24.640
L-L-L-L-Lin Zhixia.

25:48.250 --> 25:56.060
♪ Wandering light wind
drifts past your pupils ♪

25:57.030 --> 26:01.650
♪ One second of encounter,
heartstrings stirred ♪

26:02.250 --> 26:05.380
♪ The story feels altogether different ♪

26:07.800 --> 26:15.370
♪ How to describe
my whimsical wandering dream? ♪

26:16.440 --> 26:21.100
♪ You softly answer my quirky side ♪

26:21.440 --> 26:24.620
♪ Such bliss to finally be understood ♪

26:25.860 --> 26:29.590
♪ The moon drifts past the window ♪

26:26.850 --> 26:27.660
Actually,

26:30.180 --> 26:32.010
I've been secretly preparing for today
for a long time.

26:30.850 --> 26:34.810
♪ How am I to understand? ♪

26:34.240 --> 26:35.110
I always wanted

26:35.730 --> 26:36.950
♪ About you ♪

26:36.440 --> 26:37.920
to make it even prettier

26:38.110 --> 26:42.540
♪ The moment our eyes met,
my world came alive with color ♪

26:39.590 --> 26:41.050
and be even more prepared.

26:43.060 --> 26:47.540
♪ Could this be how love begins? ♪

26:43.110 --> 26:44.240
But I never expected

26:45.590 --> 26:47.830
that you'd say the words
I wanted to say to you

26:47.830 --> 26:51.010
♪ These unspoken feelings
are so hard to figure out ♪

26:48.510 --> 26:49.720
ahead of time today.

26:51.730 --> 26:56.890
♪ Hidden deep within your gaze ♪

26:52.480 --> 26:53.480
So this time,

26:54.500 --> 26:55.500
you've won again.

26:57.240 --> 27:01.700
♪ Sometimes, I imagine
drifting beyond the skies with you ♪

27:00.250 --> 27:00.790
So...

27:02.260 --> 27:06.790
♪ Shimmering light
dances over the flower in bloom ♪

27:03.070 --> 27:04.400
What did you want to say?

27:07.000 --> 27:10.080
♪ After all we've been through,
our fates remain intertwined ♪

27:07.160 --> 27:08.160
I wanted to say...

27:10.680 --> 27:17.920
♪ Perhaps fate favors me now ♪

27:10.700 --> 27:11.400
Lin Zhixia,

27:13.720 --> 27:15.750
I want to be your best friend

27:17.440 --> 27:18.570
and family forever.

27:26.010 --> 27:27.070
Let's get married.

27:30.070 --> 27:30.880
Jiang Yubai

27:31.500 --> 27:33.100
will always love Lin Zhixia.

27:36.680 --> 27:43.650
♪ Drifting along the path,
drifting through spring and winter ♪

27:37.500 --> 27:38.220
Lin Zhixia

27:39.590 --> 27:42.070
will also always love Jiang Yubai.

27:45.350 --> 27:49.490
♪ As the pen moves across the paper,
the words become blurred ♪

27:50.000 --> 27:53.910
♪ At this moment, you feel so real
yet like a dream ♪

27:54.860 --> 27:58.340
♪ The moon drifts past the window ♪

27:59.830 --> 28:03.470
♪ How am I supposed to understand? ♪

28:04.480 --> 28:05.650
♪ About you ♪

28:06.860 --> 28:11.200
♪ The moment our eyes met,
my world came alive with color ♪

28:11.870 --> 28:16.140
♪ Could this be how love begins? ♪

28:16.670 --> 28:19.730
♪ These unspoken feelings
are so hard to figure out ♪

28:20.320 --> 28:25.580
♪ Hidden deep within your gaze ♪

28:25.910 --> 28:30.490
♪ Sometimes, I imagine
drifting beyond the skies with you ♪

28:30.930 --> 28:35.460
♪ Shimmering light
dances over the flower in bloom ♪

28:35.660 --> 28:38.750
♪ After all we've been through,
our fates remain intertwined ♪

28:39.340 --> 28:45.040
♪ Perhaps fate favors me now ♪

28:57.590 --> 28:58.400
Dr. Shen.

28:59.480 --> 29:00.310
Hello.

29:01.640 --> 29:02.590
I'm sorry

29:03.070 --> 29:05.870
that I can't say goodbye to you
in person this time.

29:09.240 --> 29:11.440
By the time you hear this voice message,

29:12.440 --> 29:14.900
I'll probably have already
left this world.

29:17.680 --> 29:18.790
I was very happy

29:19.830 --> 29:21.200
in the time I had left.

29:24.000 --> 29:25.270
Thank you for fighting for

29:25.270 --> 29:27.070
every chance at treatment for me.

29:27.070 --> 29:28.650
And thank you for giving me

29:29.000 --> 29:31.880
so much courage and hope.

29:32.000 --> 29:33.790
Dr. Shen, look.

29:34.070 --> 29:35.800
There are already 20 stickers.

29:36.920 --> 29:38.380
I'll always remember you.

29:39.720 --> 29:41.000
I'll remember you too.

29:43.960 --> 29:44.750
Dr. Shen.

29:45.440 --> 29:47.790
You are truly a wonderful person.

29:48.350 --> 29:49.680
You deserve to be loved

29:51.030 --> 29:53.350
and have the very best life.

29:55.110 --> 29:58.110
So please, live your life happily

29:58.590 --> 30:01.400
and to the fullest.

30:03.670 --> 30:04.760
[Hematology Department, Shen Fuxuan]

30:06.510 --> 30:07.240
I'm leaving,

30:07.810 --> 30:08.610
Dr. Shen.

30:13.350 --> 30:14.160
Shui...

30:34.450 --> 30:37.790
[Hematology Department, Shen Fuxuan]

31:20.140 --> 31:21.750
While I was away,

31:22.440 --> 31:24.460
Jiang Yubai worked

31:25.270 --> 31:28.130
while poring over
his particle physics textbooks.

31:29.420 --> 31:30.240
I know

31:31.030 --> 31:34.310
he wasn't just preparing for
the graduate school entrance exam.

31:34.310 --> 31:35.840
He was using those formulas

31:36.330 --> 31:38.260
to fill the void left by my absence,

31:38.850 --> 31:40.770
catching up on the time

31:41.200 --> 31:44.330
slowed down by debt
with every late-night calculation.

31:45.680 --> 31:46.750
He wanted to become

31:46.940 --> 31:49.070
someone who could stand
shoulder to shoulder with me—

31:49.070 --> 31:50.200
not looking up to me,

31:50.420 --> 31:51.980
not following in my footsteps,

31:51.980 --> 31:54.780
but a lover who could
stand on equal ground with me.

31:56.900 --> 31:59.350
Shen Fuxuan devoted all his time to work.

32:00.440 --> 32:01.720
We could roughly guess

32:01.980 --> 32:03.310
what he'd been through,

32:03.850 --> 32:04.750
but no one asked.

32:04.450 --> 32:07.740
[Hematology Department]

32:05.920 --> 32:07.010
Some wounds

32:07.960 --> 32:10.550
heal best when left to mend in silence.

32:13.270 --> 32:14.610
Zeqiu and Jin Baihui's

32:16.000 --> 32:17.050
married life

32:17.070 --> 32:19.470
was as calm and steady
as a cup of warm water.

32:19.940 --> 32:21.420
Though their courtship was brief,

32:21.420 --> 32:22.680
it felt as though

32:22.750 --> 32:25.010
they'd been together their whole lives.

32:26.440 --> 32:28.180
Tang Tingting and Duan Qiyan

32:29.420 --> 32:31.570
finally took their friends' bickering

32:31.570 --> 32:33.850
and turned it into
the playful quarrels of a couple.

32:33.850 --> 32:34.510
Look.

32:35.860 --> 32:37.090
[Starring: Su Mo]

32:36.090 --> 32:36.830
It hasn't been long,

32:36.830 --> 32:38.250
and Su Mo's already starring in a movie.

32:37.110 --> 32:39.850
[The loneliness of a genius is
the ultimate romance beyond understanding]

32:38.740 --> 32:39.870
As the lead, no less.

32:39.960 --> 32:45.580
[Genius and Magic]
[In Theaters Now]

32:41.420 --> 32:44.090
His name stands out,

32:44.090 --> 32:45.420
and he's in a great spot.

32:45.700 --> 32:48.430
It's just that he's not exactly
a box office draw.

32:56.290 --> 32:57.330
I mean, his acting is solid,

32:57.330 --> 32:59.090
and he's got a really expressive gaze.

32:59.090 --> 33:00.420
He's definitely got what it takes
to become an award-winning actor.

33:00.420 --> 33:01.530
Ouch. It hurts.

33:01.980 --> 33:03.140
That's more like it.

33:03.560 --> 33:05.620
When have my standards ever been off?

33:09.180 --> 33:10.780
You're not wrong about that.

33:11.250 --> 33:14.180
If your standards were bad,
would you have chosen me?

33:15.420 --> 33:16.350
Shameless.

33:18.740 --> 33:20.010
Don't go. Wait for me.

33:25.130 --> 33:29.720
[6 months later]

33:33.920 --> 33:34.530
Finally.

33:36.220 --> 33:38.940
[Letter of Admission]

33:55.810 --> 33:56.610
I'm home.

33:56.810 --> 33:58.010
Welcome home, honey.

33:59.660 --> 34:01.180
What did you bring back this time?

34:01.180 --> 34:02.380
The things Mom and Dad gave us last time

34:02.380 --> 34:04.140
are still sitting in the fridge.
We haven't even finished them yet.

34:04.140 --> 34:05.740
These aren't those things.

34:05.980 --> 34:08.210
These are some old items from home.

34:08.860 --> 34:10.860
Mom and Dad were insisting on
throwing them away as junk,

34:10.860 --> 34:12.130
but I thought it would be a shame
to toss them,

34:12.130 --> 34:13.389
so I brought them back.

34:13.500 --> 34:14.940
I didn't know you liked this kind of stuff
as a kid,

34:14.940 --> 34:15.940
little princess.

34:16.210 --> 34:17.130
It's not mine.

34:17.130 --> 34:18.380
It's Lin Zhixia's.

34:18.780 --> 34:20.420
Lin Zhixia's been gone
for almost a year now.

34:20.420 --> 34:21.750
When is she coming back?

34:22.380 --> 34:23.170
No idea.

34:23.300 --> 34:24.760
It should be soon, though.

34:28.810 --> 34:29.969
[Gentle Battle Hymn]

34:33.230 --> 34:34.840
Don't look at this. Don't.

34:37.929 --> 34:41.480
[Everything has cracks;
that's where the light gets in.]

34:42.130 --> 34:42.860
Please

34:43.940 --> 34:45.600
pass this to Lin Zhixia for me.

34:46.860 --> 34:47.790
Leave this to me.

34:49.730 --> 34:50.590
I'll handle it.

34:52.650 --> 34:53.780
Is this my book?

34:57.210 --> 34:58.740
You glued it back together.

34:59.090 --> 35:00.210
I thought it was a great book,

35:00.210 --> 35:02.140
and it'd be a waste to throw it away.

35:06.720 --> 35:11.540
[Gentle Battle Hymn]

35:14.090 --> 35:14.980
Lin Zeqiu.

35:16.070 --> 35:19.300
Don't tell me
that you've had a crush on me

35:19.300 --> 35:20.610
since back then.

35:23.900 --> 35:24.780
No.

35:25.090 --> 35:25.860
That's not the case.

35:25.860 --> 35:26.860
Be honest with me.

35:26.940 --> 35:29.130
I'm honest. We were both too young
back then.

35:29.130 --> 35:30.820
-Give it to me.
-But you glued it back so nicely.

35:30.820 --> 35:31.420
It's not like that.

35:31.420 --> 35:32.500
Every piece is there.

35:32.500 --> 35:36.160
-Every piece looks so carefully restored.
-It's not like that...

35:38.010 --> 35:38.780
Lin Zeqiu.

35:41.780 --> 35:44.040
Thank you for finding me, piece by piece,

35:44.780 --> 35:46.440
and putting me back together.

35:55.830 --> 36:03.780
[Gentle Battle Hymn]

36:25.090 --> 36:31.440
[3 years later]

36:31.570 --> 36:33.550
Now, let's welcome the principal

36:33.650 --> 36:35.420
[Depart When the Wind Brushes Our Sleeves
Grow When Stars Fall upon Our Shoulders]

36:33.670 --> 36:35.590
to present commemorative medals
to outstanding alumni

36:35.440 --> 36:37.900
[Nanhai No. 1 High School Anniversary]

36:35.590 --> 36:37.720
including Lin Zhixia and Jiang Yubai.

36:44.960 --> 36:46.420
At this moment, we'd especially like to

36:46.420 --> 36:47.880
introduce 2 outstanding alumni:

36:47.880 --> 36:50.210
Lin Zhixia and Jiang Yubai.

36:50.210 --> 36:51.420
They are both distinguished scientists

36:51.420 --> 36:52.980
who graduated from our No. 1 High School,

36:52.980 --> 36:54.650
each achieving remarkable accomplishments

36:54.650 --> 36:56.900
in the fields of mathematics and physics.

36:56.900 --> 36:58.980
They are not only
a husband-and-wife pair of scientists,

36:58.980 --> 37:00.860
but also each other's

37:00.900 --> 37:02.610
closest classmates,

37:00.950 --> 37:01.770
[Depart When the Wind Brushes Our Sleeves
Grow When Stars Fall upon Our Shoulders]

37:01.790 --> 37:02.710
[Nanhai No. 1 High School Anniversary]

37:02.610 --> 37:04.340
dearest friends, and lifelong partners.

37:04.340 --> 37:05.780
Once again, let's give our applause

37:05.580 --> 37:06.870
[Depart When the Wind Brushes Our Sleeves
Grow When Stars Fall upon Our Shoulders]

37:05.820 --> 37:07.340
to all of our outstanding alumni.

37:06.890 --> 37:08.370
[Nanhai No. 1 High School Anniversary]

37:18.610 --> 37:20.010
I'm the one giving the speech again.

37:20.010 --> 37:22.140
You always dump this kind of work on me.

37:22.690 --> 37:25.950
It can't be helped.
You're the boss in our family after all.

37:26.170 --> 37:27.170
Don't be nervous.

37:27.210 --> 37:28.940
I'll be right there beside you.

37:29.380 --> 37:31.460
Next, please welcome Lin Zhixia,

37:31.460 --> 37:33.090
representing our outstanding alumni,

37:33.090 --> 37:34.130
to give a speech.

37:34.340 --> 37:35.090
Please.

37:42.770 --> 37:46.770
[Depart When the Wind Brushes Our Sleeves
Grow When Stars Fall upon Our Shoulders]

37:46.800 --> 37:49.670
[Nanhai No. 1 High School Anniversary]

37:48.610 --> 37:49.610
Hello, everyone.

37:49.900 --> 37:50.900
I'm Lin Zhixia.

37:52.170 --> 37:53.210
Thank you to my alma mater

37:53.210 --> 37:54.610
for giving me this honor.

37:55.820 --> 37:57.680
I'm by no means a model of success.

37:58.050 --> 37:59.130
I'm simply a fellow traveler

37:59.130 --> 38:01.660
on everyone's journey of
seeking knowledge.

38:02.980 --> 38:04.900
I'm deeply grateful to my teachers.

38:04.900 --> 38:07.090
Through their own actions, they taught me

38:07.090 --> 38:08.940
not to be afraid to ask questions—

38:08.940 --> 38:10.420
no matter how simple

38:10.460 --> 38:11.300
or naive

38:11.500 --> 38:12.380
they may seem.

38:13.530 --> 38:15.090
Many great discoveries

38:15.130 --> 38:16.460
begin with a question

38:16.500 --> 38:18.170
that others have overlooked.

38:18.210 --> 38:19.010
Class,

38:19.090 --> 38:20.260
let's give a round of applause

38:19.260 --> 38:21.060
[Constantly Strive to Become Stronger;
Strive to Be Number One]

38:20.260 --> 38:22.570
to Lin Zhixia to cheer her up.

38:23.190 --> 38:24.290
[Constantly Strive to Become Stronger;
Strive to Be Number One]

38:28.980 --> 38:30.180
Thank you, Director.

38:30.230 --> 38:30.960
All the best.

38:31.480 --> 38:32.540
I know you can do it.

38:33.730 --> 38:35.590
I'd also like to thank my friends.

38:36.590 --> 38:38.050
They've helped me realize

38:38.150 --> 38:40.550
that on the journey of
exploring the world,

38:40.550 --> 38:42.280
in addition to cold, hard data,

38:42.320 --> 38:44.650
we also need the warmth of companionship.

38:45.150 --> 38:47.400
We may go on to pursue different paths,

38:48.550 --> 38:51.400
but it's precisely this kind of
support and companionship

38:51.400 --> 38:53.030
that has built

38:53.190 --> 38:55.190
the strongest emotional foundation
between us.

38:55.190 --> 38:57.110
Aiming for first place
in the entire province.

38:57.110 --> 38:57.960
Deal.

38:58.000 --> 38:58.840
Deal.

38:58.960 --> 38:59.800
Deal.

39:08.480 --> 39:09.740
May our friendship...

39:09.800 --> 39:11.800
-Last forever!
-Last forever!

39:20.070 --> 39:21.870
I'd also like to thank my family.

39:22.230 --> 39:23.360
Although they don't know

39:23.360 --> 39:25.230
what a Hilbert space is

39:25.510 --> 39:27.570
or what quantum entanglement means,

39:27.630 --> 39:29.590
they've constructed

39:29.710 --> 39:31.320
an absolutely stable reference frame

39:31.320 --> 39:33.320
for me in the simplest possible way.

39:33.440 --> 39:34.230
Zhixia.

39:35.000 --> 39:36.360
We hope

39:37.110 --> 39:39.230
you can do what you want to do,

39:40.070 --> 39:42.150
see the scenery you want to see,

39:43.070 --> 39:44.930
and live the life you want to live.

39:45.320 --> 39:47.150
That's our biggest wish.

39:49.840 --> 39:51.440
I'd like to thank my husband.

39:52.110 --> 39:53.000
For

39:53.150 --> 39:54.630
helping me find

39:55.110 --> 39:57.320
my own way to connect with this world

39:57.710 --> 39:59.320
with infinite patience.

40:02.110 --> 40:03.150
In the universe,

40:03.510 --> 40:05.910
there's a remarkable celestial structure

40:06.030 --> 40:07.630
called a binary star system.

40:08.480 --> 40:09.940
Though they differ in mass

40:09.960 --> 40:11.110
and have distinct orbits,

40:11.110 --> 40:12.840
they revolve around each other

40:12.960 --> 40:14.020
and move together.

40:14.590 --> 40:15.670
Just like us,

40:16.400 --> 40:19.070
each going about our own lives
yet watching over one another,

40:19.070 --> 40:21.190
holding fast to our love for life

40:21.440 --> 40:23.300
and our commitment to each other.

40:25.050 --> 40:26.010
Jiang Yubai

40:26.550 --> 40:28.150
will always love Lin Zhixia.

40:28.960 --> 40:29.800
Lin Zhixia

40:30.690 --> 40:33.000
will also always love Jiang Yubai.

40:34.900 --> 40:36.550
You are like the last anchor

40:37.050 --> 40:39.010
that keeps me steady in this world.

40:39.840 --> 40:40.630
Thank you

40:41.860 --> 40:43.120
for not giving up on me.

40:44.000 --> 40:46.530
Jiang Yubai, do you know
about time capsules?

40:46.730 --> 40:48.210
Let's write down our wishes

40:48.210 --> 40:49.260
and come back and open them together

40:49.260 --> 40:50.860
when we enter middle school.

40:52.170 --> 40:53.960
Jiang Yubai, I declare that

40:54.190 --> 40:56.590
from now on,
you're my binary star partner.

40:58.170 --> 41:00.630
Finally, I'd like to share this
with you all:

41:01.420 --> 41:02.210
life

41:02.570 --> 41:05.460
is a token of the future
entrusted to time.

41:06.130 --> 41:07.530
For each of us, the future

41:07.690 --> 41:09.950
is not a destination we passively await,

41:10.260 --> 41:11.940
but a fluid reality

41:12.050 --> 41:14.580
shaped by every action we take
in the present.

41:15.170 --> 41:15.980
Therefore,

41:16.500 --> 41:19.420
the future is both the result
of our present choices

41:19.980 --> 41:22.050
and the light we project ahead.

41:25.690 --> 41:27.780
Life across the ages is like
a journey against the current;

41:27.780 --> 41:30.910
the future through the ages
is like a harmonious melody.

41:31.130 --> 41:32.460
I wish all of you

41:32.820 --> 41:33.940
to cherish today,

41:34.090 --> 41:35.260
seize the moment,

41:35.900 --> 41:37.570
live in harmony with the future,

41:37.570 --> 41:39.700
and fully embrace the freedom of life.

41:40.300 --> 41:41.210
Thank you all.

42:38.610 --> 42:40.500
♪ Warm fishbowl ♪

42:41.370 --> 42:43.210
♪ Glass sprouts forth ♪

42:43.570 --> 42:45.520
♪ Drowning at dusk ♪

42:46.340 --> 42:47.960
♪ You come to save me ♪

42:48.380 --> 42:50.190
♪ Such oddities ♪

42:51.230 --> 42:53.030
♪ Bizarre dreams ♪

42:53.410 --> 42:55.250
♪ You call them ♪

42:56.480 --> 42:57.830
♪ Déjà vu ♪

42:58.340 --> 42:59.720
♪ A random cut-in ♪

42:59.190 --> 43:00.710
This is my story.

43:00.900 --> 43:02.570
♪ 2013 ♪

43:01.480 --> 43:03.360
A story of formulas and intuition,

43:03.010 --> 43:04.740
♪ 16 times faster ♪

43:03.940 --> 43:05.230
reason and emotion,

43:05.730 --> 43:07.530
solitude and embrace.

43:05.950 --> 43:07.780
♪ The night is like a window ♪

43:08.150 --> 43:10.240
♪ The night is like the sea ♪

43:08.690 --> 43:09.460
I believe

43:09.920 --> 43:11.840
there must be countless others like me

43:10.740 --> 43:15.260
♪ Also like all the memories ♪

43:12.010 --> 43:13.820
scattered across this world.

43:14.900 --> 43:15.960
Perhaps right now,

43:16.070 --> 43:17.920
you're buried in a lab,

43:16.230 --> 43:17.740
♪ Frozen in frame ♪

43:17.970 --> 43:20.080
♪ The bluest dreamcore ♪

43:18.920 --> 43:21.090
perhaps you're lost in code,

43:20.610 --> 43:22.450
♪ Your heart is ♪

43:22.380 --> 43:23.480
or perhaps

43:22.720 --> 43:24.950
♪ A rotten one ♪

43:23.480 --> 43:25.960
you're trying to understand
this complex and fascinating world

43:25.470 --> 43:27.300
♪ Silently fading ♪

43:26.320 --> 43:29.360
through some unique language of your own.

43:27.860 --> 43:30.020
♪ Vanishing without a trace ♪

43:30.540 --> 43:32.580
♪ I walked in ♪

43:31.510 --> 43:32.690
I dedicate this story

43:32.690 --> 43:34.570
♪ But couldn't find ♪

43:33.340 --> 43:35.340
to each of you who, like me,

43:35.010 --> 43:37.240
♪ The exit ♪

43:35.820 --> 43:38.380
persist in pursuing romance
through reason;

43:37.530 --> 43:39.430
♪ You dwell within ♪

43:39.570 --> 43:41.860
and to each of you
who, though different from me,

43:40.180 --> 43:41.930
♪ My daylight flight ♪

43:42.440 --> 43:43.480
have taught me

43:42.550 --> 43:44.850
♪ The bluest dreamcore ♪

43:43.820 --> 43:46.010
another way to live.

43:45.220 --> 43:47.050
♪ Boundless, endless ♪

43:47.320 --> 43:48.630
May we all find

43:47.500 --> 43:49.490
♪ Can barely breathe ♪

43:48.630 --> 43:50.210
the orbit that belongs to us,

43:50.130 --> 43:51.900
♪ Sinking to the seabed ♪

43:51.170 --> 43:54.690
and bravely share
our own light with the world.

43:52.310 --> 43:54.510
♪ I don't know ♪

43:55.120 --> 43:57.500
♪ Why ♪

43:56.380 --> 43:57.530
I'm Lin Zhixia.

43:58.420 --> 44:01.380
Thank you for listening to my world.

44:15.500 --> 44:21.720
[The End]
